(15,'KEEP',[I,II],'theory','Mass-chain modes under an explicitly supplied delayed boundary','Masses/springs and time-shifted boundary equation are supplied. Newtonian chain equations and delayed eigenvalue algebra determine spectra and orthogonality; possible nonstandard complex modes follow the given mathematical model.'),
