(37,'KEEP',[III,VII,XII],'experimental','Thermal magnetic-curvature identification of hydrogen isotopes','The oven/field/track measurement is specified. Thermal kinetic energy distributions and Lorentz curvature scale as square-root mass over charge, allowing isotope ratios and mixture fitting without plasma-ionization-rate theory.'),
